{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0ba5e5f5d2f518c9dddda78e1ffa86d3316d41b952496d365fdf49469c44f72a", "ja": "（まつりが、衣装について何か聞きたい事が\nあるというので、来てみたんだけど……）", "zh": "（茉莉就服装的事有话想跟我说，\n所以我来找她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "365d99a6fd15799bd76fae9dc7311dedaec92f95cdcf859d33b26836ad8d9fb4", "ja": "はいほー！　{$P$}さん、\nお待ちしていたのです。どうぞこちらへ、なのです♪", "zh": "Hi Ho～！{$P$}先生，等你很久了。\n来，这边请的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3fd2f98ea3a436e930550d25282d89122b196b9c53a2c208aba09680c812ac1b", "ja": "ああ、お疲れさま、まつり。衣装の事で何か\n聞きたいって話だったけど、問題でもあったのか？", "zh": "嗯，辛苦你了，茉莉。听说你好像就\n服装的事有话想跟我说，是有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "921b96bc95e24feb9ec3454d1d203fa6c32d0b4571bd1f997408f4b7961c26b1", "ja": "ほ？　問題なんて、何もないのですよ。\n姫はこの衣装、とっても気に入っているのです♪", "zh": "哦？根本没有什么问题的喔。\n公主对这套服装非常中意的唷♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "e9dc14f9c576212e3572e3cdb246739133363428965b4d47e24a52073a9a59b1", "ja": "それより、この前{$P$}さんと\n山に行った時のことを話したかったのです。", "zh": "茉莉想说的是，之前和{$P$}先生\n一起去爬山的事情的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "190f46fac4734d3f3d68ae80660119060f3b0ff1e656bbe979eb29451917610b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、覚えてますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你还记得吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1006_p", "source_sha256": "cc32c6d25d00b86cee4376832f960ebb03d00ddfab168f77e6ed8a35d0c4839d", "ja": "ああ。あの時はまつりのおかげで、\n色々と珍しいキノコが採れたっけ。", "zh": "嗯，那个时候托茉莉的福，\n采到不少稀有的蘑菇对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "ffea89cccadcc42c710cc95fa4fc3ef82b42591fa6971e9b875b01d914c2012c", "ja": "この衣装、とってもキノコに似てるのです。\nだから、偶然なのか聞いてみたかったのです。", "zh": "这套服装看起来非常像蘑菇。\n茉莉只是想问问你这是巧合还是怎样的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6edfe3e1c4fc6814778af26ab596f094dd3bef5db23a5a78f2f5e93a8ec1ee35", "ja": "いや、偶然じゃないよ。まつりがキノコを\n可愛いって言ってたから、デザインしてもらったんだ。", "zh": "不，这不是巧合。\n因为茉莉说过蘑菇很可爱，所以我才请人设计的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1009_021mat", "source_sha256": "5eb78e2c9db5c1caf827d8557782a3f2882417384b7faa3a2eee83e84941fa48", "ja": "わんだほー！　やっぱりそうだったのです♪\nまつり、とってもうれしいのですよ。", "zh": "真是美妙──！果然是这样♪\n茉莉非常开心的唷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "2bf1d8afcf8b7b7ae5e15eb188eb04aa70d211478293f6e42fae2bb40ada328d", "ja": "キノコはウミウシに似て、\nとってもらぶりー！で、きゅーと！なのです♪", "zh": "蘑菇看起来就像海兔，\n非常迷人又可爱的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bba7fae8cc30a8ca7cb8c311ee4c89aa4a2d8239601c10fb7d77c457866a7ad3", "ja": "ウミウシ……うん、まぁ確かに、\nカラフルなところは似てるかな……？", "zh": "海兔……嗯，\n色彩缤纷这点是有点像……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "a5365bbfd611cd1c0a437e3c718f5eca0bc5fbc63102ee5f0f732e475abb9b39", "ja": "はいなのです！　だからかわいい姫には、\nぴったりなモチーフなのですよ？", "zh": "是啊！所以这设计和可爱的公主\n再适合不过了喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1013_021mat", "source_sha256": "1a64eaac5c91c7484a54d7b261b41ee54f955313b69a26142d4be8afad9b32b9", "ja": "{$P$}さんが気づいてくれて、\n姫ははっぴー！なのです♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生有发现这点，\n公主好开心～的呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8dfe43972fc6e1e78730f5656212eeda73408b060b3b6776c5192bb7857ca721", "ja": "そうか。まつりが喜んでくれて良かったよ。", "zh": "这样啊，茉莉喜欢真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "1f2ce8479c36886a00ce3a44f1ffd012806503be1c6ea341e263bca6b710f328", "ja": "とってもうれしいのです～。\nきっとファンのみんなも、ほめてくれるのです♪", "zh": "茉莉超开心的喔～\n粉丝一定也会称赞茉莉的呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "7456d921ffadf751373e43c3a24c9137b5944cd08117e89db15e48a8b36da688", "ja": "ああ、そういえばブログに、ファンのみんなから\nコメントが来てたな。見てみるか？", "zh": "对啊，说到这个，已经有粉丝\n在部落格留言了，你要看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "d9291908f899d76408d175000b889e24663d2817f0c14d0bf0da87bbc1d943d8", "ja": "ほ？　そうなのです？\nでは、帰ってからしっかり見るのです！", "zh": "哦？是吗？\n那茉莉回去以后再慢慢看的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1018_021mat", "source_sha256": "07723d883418330bb250a6b90295fc945c0036d34342362ab92236d3dae476ba", "ja": "みんなの感想、姫も知りたいのです。でも一番は、\n歌って踊っているところを見せたいのです♪", "zh": "公主也很好奇大家的感想，但公主最想要的\n还是唱歌跳舞给大家看的喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "40f6756c3873451e0a5e4c205d393e6f74e19c012e5e01a1566369aeca63bd4e", "ja": "キノコの魔法をかけた素敵なステージを、みんなに\n見せてあげるのです。きらきら、ほわほわなのです～♪", "zh": "公主要让大家看到施展蘑菇魔法的美妙表演，\n闪亮亮又轻飘飘的唷～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f9ab158df7c13c62c0ec0380d090def4e06eba29e95036505372988250b49fae", "ja": "ああ……うん、そうだな！\nまつりの、ステージ衣装だもんな。", "zh": "好……嗯，说得对！\n毕竟这是茉莉的表演服装嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1021_021mat", "source_sha256": "56a4b8cd7b65fee549f4790597d624c183a486c668decaac6289c3920c04eb83", "ja": "はいなのです♪　だから{$P$}さんも\n楽しみにしていてほしいのです。", "zh": "是啊♪所以{$P$}先生\n也要好好期待的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_021mat0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_021mat0084_1022_021mat", "source_sha256": "cbe666c0e119487695aa74ace0e4ce9ad8c29522e1aa706f7f7c1c6a91b81049", "ja": "キノコ狩りの素敵な思い出も、素敵な\n魔法のスパイスになってるんだよ。……だから、ね？", "zh": "采蘑菇的美好回忆，\n就是绝佳的魔法调味料……所以，呐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
